{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b947db88deed3e0e","name":"Antipersonnel Mine","source":{"id":"source:reference-b947db88deed3e0e","title":"Antipersonnel Mine","revision":17939,"timestamp":"2024-08-24T17:25:47Z","sha256":"c405f180691d6247f6bc8786ccd3f64194f9942cc5bb986bdb400bc839aaf771","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=17939","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Antipersonnel%20Mine&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b947db88deed3e0e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Antipersonnel Mine is a shaped ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosive"}," that discharges shrapnel in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"},", rather than exploding over an area. Retractable magnetic spikes on the bottom of the Mine allow it to be securely placed in the ground or attached to a metallic object, such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or building. It can be detonated using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Timer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Timer"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manual Trigger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manual_Trigger","referenceId":"reference:3bac33a88449a688"},", or a tripwire. Setting up a tripwire requires a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. Any character, creature, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moving into a wired square detonates the Mine. Multiple Antipersonnel Mines can be linked together with an additional DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check per Mine. When one Mine is activated, all the linked Mines detonate, each dealing separate damage to all targets within the area of effect. An Antipersonnel Mine damages everything in a 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"}," in a direction that is determined when the Mine is placed and activated.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mines are designed for placement in the ground or to be otherwise hidden from sight. Any character attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Notice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Notice"}," a Mine takes a -5 penalty to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check. Setting a Mine is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," and does not require a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. However, attaching a detonator (either Timed or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manual_Trigger","referenceId":"reference:3bac33a88449a688"},") requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check and overrides the Mine's built-in triggering system.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 6d6 (Piercing)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Radius:"]}," 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
